I leave my house.
I am going towards the bus stop.
It is morning time.
A cool breeze is blowing.
I go to the office by bus every day.
The bus stop is near my building.
I reach the bus stop.
Some people are waiting for the bus there.
I also join a short line.
A woman is standing in front of me.
She is talking on the phone.
I am looking towards the road.
Many cars and autos are running on the road.
I am waiting for my regular BEST bus.
From afar, a red bus is coming.
This is my BEST bus.
The bus stops at the stop.
The line is moving forward.
Now I am boarding the bus.
